CORE
genvar_scope10.sv
--bound 0
^\[main\.property\.p1\] always main\.some_wire1 == 2'b10: PROVED up to bound 0$
^\[main\.property\.p2\] always main\.some_wire2 == 2'b01: PROVED up to bound 0$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Two loop generate constructs in the same scope, whose bodies are not
surrounded by begin-end, may both declare a genvar with the same name in
their header. A body without begin-end is a generate block, and hence a
scope, 1800-2017 27.4.
